{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　\nこんばちは\n最近ズボンを全部裾上げしてます。今時の人はみんな足が長いのかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐々木久美です🦒くみてんです🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマス、ひなくり2021楽しかったですね🎄本当〜に楽しすぎたので私の心の中はまだまだクリスマスなのです☃️🤍"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W59BYARNNTQENQJH1B652","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W5ADFXEDMPNA5P3X2419M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のひなくりはおひさまのところにたっくさん行けてすっごく幸せな気持ちになりました。タオルもペンライトもうちわもぜーんぶ見えました本当にありがとう🥺🖤私たちの生きる力です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W5BF0FDX3J36QTNGRE4TF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nそして、2日目の最後に発表させていただきましたが3回目のひな誕祭が東京ドームで開催されることになりました🥚\nずっとお待たせしてしまってごめんなさい。ついに約束の卵におひさまの皆さんと行けます！ずっと夢見て歌を歌って来ましたMCでも言いましたが、正直不安はなくてワクワクしています！今から本当に楽しみなんです！！\nみーんなが楽しめる最高のひな誕祭にしたいとおもいます❤️‍🔥お楽しみに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ🐶\n明日28日10:30〜テレビ東京「日経スペシャル夢を叶えるイッテンモノを作れ！コラボの泉」に出演させていただきます！\n是非ご覧くださいませ🦌☁️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中の「BRODY」さん一期生で表紙をさせていただいてます💠インタビューも併せて読んでください〜\nみーんな素で撮影を楽しみました🧚‍♀️"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W5CH8BRHKSXXPTY52CDDE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W5DNQWEQ0K4P8HKRZWBF5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W5EQM0RQG8SCBKCXMDDT2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W5FYP36WA04QY3MTYFAMS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W5H0X80P6VRTZE00J265R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W5JA2E5Q0YZAX31MF9WKR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#KUMIFILMオフショット🐻‍❄️"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W5KD9H6VXZ55P9XHHZ3JG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W5MDJNJ2QBNJX2GSAZXKS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W5NHTMTT0PTASVAMCQKZ9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}